Description: C Libraries for the Unidata network Common Data Form (intel + mpich, OpenHPC)
 NetCDF is a set of software libraries and machine-independent data formats
 that support the creation, access, and sharing of array-oriented scientific data.
 Built with the intel compiler family and mpich MPI stack.
 .
 This package is part of the OpenHPC project.
